Modifications to the model files in this repository:
  - body/myofullbody_clean.xml and body/myofullbody_clean_kneefix.xml are copies of the
    released body/myofullbody.xml (musclemimic_models 1.0.5) without its scene include
    (floor and skybox) and with a headlight / offscreen-size block added;
  - leg/assets/myolegs_assets_kneefix.xml is a copy of leg/assets/myolegs_assets.xml in
    which the left knee's coupled rotation / translation coefficients are fixed (they
    turned the left shank the wrong way with knee flexion); body/myofullbody_clean_kneefix.xml
    includes it.

The browser viewer (docs/viewer/) loads three.js (MIT License) from a CDN.

